      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this absolutely fantastic three-bedroom / two-bathroom apartment to the market within the prestigious Carrigmore Crescent development, Citywest. The phrase 'location, location, location' immediately springs to mind as this magnificent development is ideally positioned less than five minutes' walk from the Luas and also within a mere stone's throw you will find the Citywest Shopping Centre, choice of bus routes giving easy access to the City Centre and a host of major road networks.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 89 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, modern fully fitted kitchen, large open plan living/dining area, three double bedrooms (one master ensuite) with built in wardrobes and main family bathroom. A door from the living area leads onto a low maintenance balcony overlooking the courtyard with a highly sought after south west facing orientation making it the perfect sun trap on them long sunny summer evenings. \r\n\r\nNo. 30 Carrigmore Crescent comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years, it has been freshly renovated over the years with fresh painting, new flooring and top-quality fixtures & fittings. These apartments are exceptionally spacious and offer a lengthy list of striking features such as double-glazed windows, new top spec radiators, ample parking and sunny south west facing balcony to name but a few. Mixed interest is sure to be seen from a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder, investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area and people looking to downsize. \r\n\r\nRegister your interest today with Ray Cooke Auctioneers. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 89 sqm \r\n- BER C2\r\n- 3 bed 2 bath \r\n- Apartment \r\n- 3 parking spaces included \r\n- Superbly maintained \r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Freshly renovated in recent years \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Electric heating\r\n- New top spec radiators \r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Large open plan living/dining area \r\n- Three double bedrooms \r\n- Master ensuite \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Sunny south west facing balcony\r\n- Overlooking courtyard \r\n- Plenty of natural sunlight \r\n- Top quality flooring throughout \r\n- Overlooking courtyard to rear \r\n- Ample parking\r\n- X3 designated parking permits \r\n- Overground and underground parking \r\n- Located in highly sought-after area\r\n- Luas stop within 5 minutes' walk \r\n- Citywest shopping centre on your doorstep \r\n- M50 & N7 within easy reach \r\n- Viewing highly advised \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom the Naas Road take Exit 3 for Citywest. At the roundabout at the top of the slip road turn right. Proceed straight ahead until you reach the City West Shopping Centre and at this roundabout continue along and turn left onto Carrigmore Elms and proceed straight ahead then turn left where Carrigmore Crescent will be on your left."
      },
